      hook: 'Jim explores the island alone. He hears a scream. He presses on through the forest.',
      tour: `Jim, alone in the interior, crosses a marsh and open sandy ground. He is uneasy and alert — he has just watched Silver kill a man. A scream from the direction of the shore tells him another of the loyal sailors has been killed. He presses on rather than going back. He is beginning to understand that there is no good direction to run in on this island.`,
      blurb: `Jim crosses the island interior alone. A scream from the shore — another loyal sailor killed. He presses on. Running back to the ship is not possible; running forward is all that is left.`,
